OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785419297
OL,3,CWoman accused of breaching Donaldson
OL,4,Cvictims' anonymity
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested and charged
OL,7,Fwith breaching the anonymity of the
OL,8,Fvictims of former DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,9,FDonaldson.
OL,11,FDonaldson was convicted of 18 sex
OL,12,Foffences, including one count of rape,
OL,13,Frelating to two women when they were
OL,14,Fchildren between 1985 and 2008.
OL,16,FOn Wednesday the PSNI said detectives
OL,17,Ffrom Newry Criminal Investigation
OL,18,FDepartment investigating an alleged
OL,19,Fbreach of anonymity had charged a 55-
OL,20,Fyear-old woman.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/4
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
