FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785419297
OL,3,CWoman accused of breaching Donaldson
OL,4,Cvictims' anonymity
OL,6,FThe woman was arrested in the
OL,7,FBallynahinch area on Tuesday and has
OL,8,Fbeen charged with a breach of a
OL,9,Flifetime ban on reporting the identity
OL,10,Fof alleged victims.
OL,12,FShe is due to appear at Downpatrick
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court on Monday August 24.
OL,15,FIn the UK, child victims of sexual
OL,16,Foffences have automatic lifelong
OL,17,Fanonymity that applies whether the
OL,18,Fvictim is a child or an adult at the
OL,19,Ftime of legal proceedings.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/4
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
