CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785419297
OL,3,CWoman accused of breaching Donaldson
OL,4,Cvictims' anonymity
OL,6,FThe two victims at the centre of the
OL,7,FDonaldson trial were referred to as
OL,8,FComplainant A and Complainant B.
OL,10,FDonaldson is being held at Maghaberry
OL,11,FPrison awaiting sentencing, and his
OL,12,Fsolicitor John McBurney has previously
OL,13,Fconfirmed that papers have been lodged
OL,14,Ffor an appeal.
OL,16,FEarlier this month Donaldson was
OL,17,Fstripped of his knighthood.
